OL,3,GNEWSAMotion of no-confidence in
OL,4,Auniversity chief passes
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnion members at the University of
OL,7,FSheffield have passed a motion of no
OL,8,Fconfidence in the vice-chancellor in a
OL,9,Fdispute over job cuts and workload.
OL,11,FThe University and College Union (UCU)
OL,12,Fsaid 1,600 staff and post-graduate
OL,13,Fresearchers voted in favour of the
OL,14,Fmotion on Friday.
OL,16,FIt said more than 500 staff had lost
OL,17,Ftheir jobs through voluntary severance
OL,18,Fsince November 2024 and four more
OL,19,Fdepartments were set for cuts.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
